<title>USA: Des Plaines, Ill., $5.050 mln won by Griffin.</title>
<headline>Des Plaines, Ill., $5.050 mln won by Griffin.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik, Stephens &amp; Thompson, Inc. said it won $5.030 million of Des Plaines, Ill., general obligation taxable bonds, Series 1997 C,with a net  interest cost of 7.07 percent.</p>
</text>
